The material from SkillEvaluator v0.6.0 in this repository is:

- skillevaluator-patch/skillevaluator-0.6.0-skill-ci.patch, a patch to
  src/skillevaluator/cli.py, src/skillevaluator/tier3/harbor/runner.py and
  src/skillevaluator/tier3/harbor/local_agents.py. The patch carries lines of
  those files as context. The changes were made by the skill-ci Authors and
  are listed at the top of the patch.
- harbor-agent-sandbox/tests/fixtures/skillevaluator-0.6.0.Dockerfile, a
  Dockerfile generated by SkillEvaluator 0.6.0, kept unchanged as a test
  fixture.
- Three RUN steps in sandbox/Dockerfile (the verifier package install, the
  import check and the directory setup), copied from that generated
  Dockerfile.

The runner image (ghcr.io/dirien/skill-ci-runner) contains SkillEvaluator
v0.6.0 with the patch applied, together with its LICENSE, NOTICE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in /opt/skillevaluator.

